# -- String and StringView ---------------------------------------------
# The demand-gated bodies live in _Z_SV_* fragments; everything else is in the
# unconditionally loaded z_String.inc / z_StringView.inc, or is a projection --
# String's startsWith IS StringView's, reached by viewing the receiver, so the
# view owns the fragment and the String row states only that the native exists.
# The comparisons and `+` are operator rows above; these are the rest.

